{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Jos Buttler\u00a0has been handed over the trophy. Right then! All smiles in the England camp and\u00a0that ends another series here. With this, all the teams are done with their preparation before the World Cup. England\u00a0will now play a warm-up game against Pakistan, while Australia\u00a0will be up against India in the warm-up match. Both these matches will be played on 17th October 2022, which is just around the corner. From here, it's goodbye!", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:47:15+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Jos Buttler\u00a0the skipper of England\u00a0is also the Player of the series! He says that they have enjoyed\u00a0it here\u00a0and are happy\u00a0that\u00a0they have continued their form from Pakistan. Adds that they were just two overs left so they wanted to give it their all, but it's a shame they could not get a game here. Mentions that Chris Woakes's\u00a0opening over was brilliant, he got the ball to swing for them which is good news.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:42:38+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Aaron Finch\u00a0the skipper of Australia\u00a0says it was quite a bit of rain last night and it has been frustrating and they could have been happier with a full game. Adds that England\u00a0outplayed them in all three games but they will need to improve on their fielding a bit. Further says that\u00a0it was difficult to bat as well. Ends by saying that they do get a couple of days to recharge\u00a0before the World Cup.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:40:33+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Stay tuned for the presentation...", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:50:13+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Earlier in the match, Australia\u00a0put their opposition to bat first. After a few interruptions,\u00a0England\u00a0managed to post a total of 112 for 2 in 12 overs, coursety of a fine 65 from the skipper, Jos Buttler.\u00a0The target was then changed to 130 cause of the DLS method. In reply, we could only get in 3.5 overs in which, Chris Woakes\u00a0demolished Australia's top order and had them reeling at 30 for 3 before the match was eventually called off.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:38:23+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "That's it, folks! The news that none of us would have liked to hear. But the match has been called off. With this, Australia\u00a0might feel a tad lucky, they were struggling at 30 for 3 at the start of the second innings. But things could have\u00a0turned out to be different. Anyway, it's England\u00a0that have won the series 2-0 and will walk into the mega event after having defeated the defending champions in their own backward yard. They will be oozing with confidence before the World Cup, while the hosts have some thinking to do.", "Timestamp": "2022-10-14T11:50:03+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Over_No": "", "Ball": "", "Ball_Line_Length": "", "This_Over": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "